{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>Maitan69 旗下遊戲 Evan's Remains 現於 Epic Games Android 平台 限時免費 ，優惠至 9 月 10 日 23:00（香港時間）截止。作品結合懸疑驚悚劇情與邏輯平台解謎，玩家需追查失蹤少年 Evan 的下落。</p><p>遊戲以日式圖像冒險風格推進故事，每解開兩至三個謎題便會揭開新劇情及機關；後期更會混合多種已介紹的玩法，考驗玩家理解解法而非操作技巧。官方資料未有提及 DLC。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f5cd8aa21d7447a4accaa68c6f6f0aa83fe6e3dfc1aa1faf2c67ec17d4437911/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F750845cd4bb8031c93b14bfc8d3ea5f5.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8986eff3f6ab6169ed8e7b854bbdb98a839786de3f6c37068b8b876e91ad6427/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F93852220cb78a5422c9a3ddef7c47c54.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e29cec1be23007265fbe27b96afb02171a234533487b5c09faa48c55b39ac5d9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2Fccd4482cb07a453f987454fe2a034942.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8f6d96d14a666f51ca92fe1af00f1b7c1397b87283f69def60132a1ca15134e0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F16fd8da841818c3b1077f78ca2a78244.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d19db27c2e8ccaf3d46323eddeff9b9c91d881c5b0a9b1a10bedad4e38c253dd/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F82beaeb5814327e7415c5c373e1d544c.jpg\"/><p>遊戲名稱：Evan's Remains 支援平台：Android 領取位置： Epic Games</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T08:15:41.819201+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":254,"images":5,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}